SUMMARY:Niagara Falls at night by casino bus. With fireworks\, karaoke\, m
 ore
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\nPeople 
 enjoy Niagara Falls and ask for more group trips so here we go again!\n\nT
 his trip's for the adventurous night owls. Summer is here and it's time to
  check out this lovely natural wonder of the world\, Niagara Falls.\n\nWe'
 ll be headed there on comfortable [Safeway Tours bus](https://safewaytours
 .net/casino). With free wifi and onboard bathroom.\n\nNOTE - It's up to yo
 u to contact Safeway Tours and book your spot on the bus. Saturdays are bu
 sy so highly recommend you make a reservation\n\n**Cost** - **$50 cash.** 
 Must bring **cash** for the [casino bus](https://safewaytours.net/casino).
  Once you arrive at the casino they will give you $40 in casino credit tha
 t you can play with and \, hopefully\, grow even bigger.\n\nAlso bring gov
 ernment ID\, cash\, credit \, debit for whatever you plan to eat\,drink \,
  gamble\, etc.\n\nWhatsApp for this trip\n\n[https://chat.whatsapp.com/Fqr
 aC7g3zH94bVl6Q4teZY](https://chat.whatsapp.com/FqraC7g3zH94bVl6Q4teZY)\n\n
 Join the main [Whatapps group ](https://chat.whatsapp.com/JpUbpvfPcNuFzTJ1
 VqTLZO) for discussions\, questions\, etc regarding our group\n\n**Itinera
 ry** \\- Meet at Broadview/Gerrard to take the **6PM Safeway Tours bus** t
 o Niagara Falls. Do not be late\, bus won't wait.\n\n[https://safewaytours
 .net/casino?view=1](https://safewaytours.net/casino?view=1)\n\n8:30PM - ar
 rive at Niagara Falls\n\nMy plan is to walk down Clifton Hill \, look at a
 musements along the way\, then head closer to the Falls.\n\n[https://www.n
 iagarafallstourism.com/play/attractions/](https://www.niagarafallstourism.
 com/play/attractions/)\n\nAt some point I may be doing karaoke at [ Jimmy 
 Buffet's Margaritaville.](https://www.margaritavilleniagara.ca/) Come to s
 ing or just to watch and enjoy.\n\nThen around 10PM we gather once more to
  watch the lovely free fireworks display over the Falls.\n\n[https://www.n
 iagarafallstourism.com/fireworks/](https://www.niagarafallstourism.com/fir
 eworks/)\n\nAfter fireworks you have a few options. Take the 12:30AM retur
 n bus\,\nor stay later for the 3AM return bus\, provided space is availabl
 e on it (not guaranteed).\n\nOn trip back our bus stops at Bremner /Spadin
 a (by request) \, Spadina/ Dundas\, College/Yonge\, and then final stop is
  Broadview /Gerrard\n\n**Q - Can I drive instead?**\n\nA - Not for this on
 e. Tricky to coordinate driver and bus passengers\n\n**Q - What should I b
 ring?**\n\nA - **Government issued ID. Must be 19+ for the bus.** Weather 
 appropriate clothing\, trip goes rain or shine. $50 cash for casino bus . 
 Stuff for the bus ride (neck pillow\, snacks\, charging cable\, battery pa
 ck\, headphones)\n\nComfortable walking shoes. We'll be walking everywhere
  once we get to the Falls.\n\n**Q - Do I have to sing karaoke?**\n\nA - No
 t at all. Can watch others do it and just enjoy.\n\n**Q - Can I come back 
 on later 3AM bus?**\n\nA - Yes but only if they have room. Your guaranteed
  return spot is on the 12:30AM bus.\n\n**Q - Can I stay overnight?**\n\nA 
 - Yes. You are responsible for booking your own hotel and changing your re
 turn time with Safeway Tours. The next bus back to Toronto on Sunday June 
 28 is at 11:45AM.\n\nConsider joining our [Whatsapp](https://chat.whatsapp
 .com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc?mode=ac_t) to discuss this and future events t
 oo\n\n**PLEASE REVIEW RULES:** [CLICK HERE!](https://www.meetup.com/Toront
 o-Movies-and-Outings-Group/pages/6014492/Rules/)\n\n**REMEMBER YOU CAN JUS
 T SHOW UP ON THE DAY OF EVENT IF YOU ARE NOT SURE YOU CAN MAKE IT.**\n\n**
 NOTE:** Sometimes things happen and I might have to cancel so please keep 
 a look out for that!\n\n**Don't Forget to join our email list** (Meetup do
 es not send out emails to\neveryone in a group) to get our weekly news lat
 er about upcoming events: [http://eepurl.com/hKt76f](http://eepurl.com/hKt
 76f)\n\n*Nicolas is the organizer for this meetup. If you need to contact 
 him\, please post a message on the wall\, or email him at* nicolasbello@ya
 hoo.com
