SUMMARY:Canada Day Bonfire Night!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🔥 **
 Bonfire Night: The Ultimate Canada Day Hangout** 🇨🇦\nCelebrate Canad
 a Day the *right* way—with fire\, food\, and music under the stars! Join
  us at **Etienne Brulé Park** for an unforgettable evening of good vibes\
 , marshmallow roasting\, and laid-back fun right in the heart of Toronto. 
 As the sun sets and the bonfire crackles\, connect with great people and k
 ick off summer in the best way possible. Whether you’re new to the city 
 or a longtime local\, this is *the* place to be on July 1st.\n🎶🔥 Let
 ’s make some warm memories this Canada Day!\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp 
 Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lM
 leUd)\n\n**Celebrate with Fire\, Food & Friends in the Heart of Toronto!**
 \n**Date:** Canada Day – **July 1st**\n**Time:** Meet at 6:30 PM\n**Loca
 tion:** Etienne Brulé Park (Close to the parking lot and washrooms)\n👉
  [CLICK HERE FOR MAP!](https://www.google.com/maps/place/Etienne+Brul%C3%A
 9+Park/@43.6519009\,-79.5013104\,15.75z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x882b36f396180ca1
 :0xa14c3a98a738e615!8m2!3d43.6517494!4d-79.4903289!16zL20vMGRka3hi?entry=t
 tu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D)\n**Organizer:** Mathew (look
  for the Moose Hat!)\n**Event ends at 10:30 PM**\n\n***\n\n### 🎟 **How 
 to Join**\n\nTo attend\, please send a **$10 e-transfer** to **mathewmacle
 an@hotmail.com** **within 24 hours of signing up**.\nIf payment is not rec
 eived\, your RSVP will be removed.\n💡 **No refunds** unless the event i
 s cancelled. We go rain or shine!\nNot sure if you can make it? You can ch
 eck for open spots and sign up the day of—or just show up (if there's sp
 ace).\n\n**PLEASE NOTE: IF YOU ARE ON THE WAITING LIST\, DON'T NOT SEND MO
 NEY UNTIL I REACH OUT TO YOU THROUGH TEXT.**\n\n💰 **What Your $10 Cover
 s**\n✅ City permit\n✅ Firewood\n✅ Hot dogs (beef\, pork\, and veggie
 ) with buns & sauces\n✅ Marshmallows\n✅ Music\n✅ Shared roasting sti
 cks (bring your own if you have one!)\n\n***\n\n### 📍 **Meeting Info**\
 n\n* 🧢 **Mathew will be wearing a Moose Hat for the first hour.**\n* 
 🔥 At the fire pit (Close to the parking lot and washrooms)\n* 🚇 **TT
 C Meetup:** Outside of Mills Subway Station and I will be wearing my Moose
  Hat at 6:00 PM (Mathew will wait 10 minutes before walking over)\n* 🚗 
 **Parking:** Some free\, some paid spots nearby\n\n***\n\n### 📦 **What 
 to Bring**\n\n* 🥤 **Your own drinks** (NO drinks provided)\n* 🍪 Some
 thing to share with the group (snacks or games)\n* 🍻 BYOB (Yes\, you ca
 n drink in the park!)\n* 🪑 Folding chair or blanket\n* 🧥 Sweater or 
 something warm\n* 🐶 Dogs welcome! (and well-behaved kids)\n* 🎲 Group
  games encouraged!\n\n***\n\n### ❌ Please Note\n\n🚭 **No smoking\, va
 ping\, or drug use near the fire pit.**\nAnyone found breaking this rule w
 ill be asked to leave.\n\n***\n\n### 🎉 Who This Is For\n\nThis event is
  for *anyone looking to make friends\, be social\, and enjoy the summer*. 
 Whether you're single or not\, new to Toronto or a local—**everyone’s 
